# Options on the procedural UI system. The shell creates this .wnd as a layout over the main menu (and in game), with a
# root that used to draw a half-dark fill: it is a dialog now. A 1600 x 900 raised panel centred on a scrim (x 160..1760,
# y 90..990): title, four groups in two columns (Display, Audio / Controls, Network), Defaults at the left of the bottom
# row, Cancel and Accept at the right. The advanced display options window is a second dialog over it. Units: 1 = frame
# height / 1080.
hide at:0,0,799,599
scrim
window $OptionsMenuParent left top 0 0 1920 1080
hide $OptionsMenuParent
window $OptionsMenuParentOld centre middle 0 0 1600 900 dialog
hide $Line
hide $Line1
hide $Line2
hide $Line3
hide $Line4

window text:GUI:Options left top 184 110 600 32 section
rule left top 184 150 1552

# ---- display (left, top) ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
window $VideoParent left top 184 176 760 344
hide $VideoParent
window text:GUI:DisplayOptions left top 184 176 400 24 meta
rule left top 184 206 760
window $ResolutionLabel left top 184 224 360 24 meta
window $ComboBoxResolution left top 184 252 360 44 dropdown
window $DetailLabel left top 584 224 360 24 meta
window $ComboBoxDetail left top 584 252 360 44 dropdown
window $GammaLabel left top 184 324 360 24 meta
window $SliderGamma left top 184 352 760 44 slider

# ---- audio (right, top) ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
window $AudioParent left top 976 176 760 344
hide $AudioParent
window text:GUI:AudioOptions left top 976 176 400 24 meta
rule left top 976 206 760
window $MusicVolumeLabel left top 976 224 360 24 meta
window $SliderMusicVolume left top 976 252 760 44 slider
window $SFXVolumeLabel left top 976 324 360 24 meta
window $SliderSFXVolume left top 976 352 760 44 slider
window $VoiceVolumeLabel left top 976 424 360 24 meta
window $SliderVoiceVolume left top 976 452 760 44 slider

# ---- controls (left, bottom) -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
window $ScrollParent left top 184 544 760 336
hide $ScrollParent
window text:GUI:ControlOptions left top 184 544 400 24 meta
rule left top 184 574 760
window $CheckAlternateMouse left top 184 592 360 40 checkbox
window $CheckDoubleClickAttackMove left top 584 592 360 40 checkbox
window $Retaliation left top 184 640 360 40 checkbox
window $ScrollSpeedLabel left top 184 712 360 24 meta
window $SliderScrollSpeed left top 184 740 760 44 slider

# ---- network (right, bottom) -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
window $NetworkParent left top 976 544 760 336
hide $NetworkParent
window text:GUI:NetworkOptions left top 976 544 400 24 meta
rule left top 976 574 760
window $StaticTextOnlineIpAddresses left top 976 592 360 24 meta
window $ComboBoxOnlineIP left top 976 620 360 44 dropdown
window $StaticTextLANIpAddresses left top 1376 592 360 24 meta
window $ComboBoxIP left top 1376 620 360 44 dropdown
window $StaticTextFirewallPortOverride left top 976 692 360 24 meta
window $TextEntryFirewallPortOverride left top 976 720 200 44 entry
window $ButtonFirewallRefresh left top 1196 720 140 44 button
window $StaticTextHTTPProxy left top 1376 692 360 24 meta
window $TextEntryHTTPProxy left top 1376 720 360 44 entry
window $CheckSendDelay left top 976 792 400 40 checkbox

# ---- bottom row ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
window $ButtonDefaults left top 184 922 200 44 button
window $LabelVersion left top 404 930 600 28 meta
window $ButtonBack left top 1336 922 200 44 button
window $ButtonAccept left top 1556 922 180 44 primary

# ---- advanced display options: a dialog over the options (shown by code) -------------------------------------------
window $WinAdvancedDisplayOptions centre middle 0 0 1000 760 dialog
hide $AdvanceOptionsLine
window text:GUI:AdvanceDisplayOptions left top 484 180 600 32 section
window parent:$Check3DShadows left top 484 232 952 300
hide parent:$Check3DShadows
hide $ToggleOnOffLine
window text:GUI:AdvancedOptionsToggleOnOff left top 484 232 600 24 meta
window $Check3DShadows left top 484 264 440 40 checkbox
window $Check2DShadows left top 484 308 440 40 checkbox
window $CheckCloudShadows left top 484 352 440 40 checkbox
window $CheckGroundLighting left top 484 396 440 40 checkbox
window $CheckSmoothWater left top 484 440 440 40 checkbox
window $CheckBehindBuilding left top 960 264 440 40 checkbox
window $CheckShowProps left top 960 308 440 40 checkbox
window $CheckExtraAnimations left top 960 352 440 40 checkbox
window $CheckNoDynamicLOD left top 960 396 440 40 checkbox
window $CheckHeatEffects left top 960 440 440 40 checkbox
window $CheckUnlockFPS left top 960 484 440 40 checkbox
window $LowResWin left top 484 540 952 140
hide $LowResWin
hide $LowResLine
window text:GUI:LowResSlider left top 484 540 600 24 meta
window $LowResSlider left top 484 572 952 44 slider
window text:GUI:LowResFaster left top 484 620 400 24 meta
window text:GUI:HighResSlower left top 1036 620 400 24 meta
window $ParticleCapWin left top 484 700 952 140
hide $ParticleCapWin
hide $ParticleCapLine
window text:GUI:ParticleCap left top 484 700 600 24 meta
window $ParticleCapSlider left top 484 732 952 44 slider
window text:GUI:LessParticlesFaster left top 484 780 400 24 meta
window text:GUI:MoreParticlesSlower left top 1036 780 400 24 meta
window $ButtonAdvanceBack left top 484 852 180 44 button
window $ButtonAdvanceAccept left top 1236 852 200 44 primary
